__pycache__/
*.pyc

# never commit an exported session or a build payload
*cookies*.json
*payload*.json

# research loop (this repo is public): raw scrapes hold other people's posts verbatim,
# and two of the four digests are personal — the author's Notion, and private-group posts quoted verbatim.
# Both stay on this machine only; x_digest.md, arxiv.md, style_brief.md, selection.md, backlog.md and the outlines are committed.
.context/
research/*/notion_digest.md
research/*/community_digest.md
